 "purpose": "Fills sentence templates into pieces of text with markable data and keywords, for word problems.",
 "details": "A template mixes plain text with {name} slots, {a thing} (a datum with its noun, correct singular/plural), {thing.enk}, {de:thing}, {elk:thing}, {een:thing} (number and article forms), {?} for the answer box and *...* for key words that light up with the first tip. vul() turns a template and a context dict into a list of Stuk objects (kern/modellen); woorden() and regels() then cut those into words and lines of a given width so the screen can wrap them without losing which words are data. Words are stored in the JSON worlds as 'singular|plural|article'.",
 "module_docstring": "Sjablonen invullen tot zinnen met aanduidbare gegevens en sleutelwoorden (voor vraagstukken).",
